# 调用方把自己的形参传给被调者时，被调者的返回值式子照样代换（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0092）。原来结果里有 p<k> 就当"被调者形参没换掉"、未知，
# Mid 记 SUSPECT entry_unproven，链断在中间。正文不露 _unknown<k>。
#
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ReportSafe=true \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=summary -analyzer-config 'rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:DumpFilter=^Twice$' \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/cpret/c.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK-DAG: c.c:7:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 2-level call chain: up to byte 5 of 'a' (4 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: c.c:8:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:within] Proven within bounds: up to byte 4 of 'a' (4 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: c.c:11:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 2-level call chain: up to byte 5 of 'a' (4 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: c.c:12:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:within] Proven within bounds: up to byte 4 of 'a' (4 bytes)
# Twice：第二次调用的实参是 p0 + 1（原来 _unknown0）；它可能回绕，结果照旧不代换，R7 仍 SUSPECT，正文不露内部名字
CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"args":["p0 + 1"],"callee":"Idx"
CHECK-DAG: c.c:15:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:entry_unproven] Cannot prove the write through a 1-level call chain stays within 'a' (4 bytes): up to byte an unknown value + 1 may be accessed
